Hi Chris,

as a follow-up to this issue, removing any use of clearCompiled function in the code solved the problem. I will therefore add this option in runMCMC_btadjust - to use or not to use clearCompiled function, as it seems to be useful in some settings and not in others.

Sincerely,

Frédéric

