Hi Rod,

If the dimension/length of any variable is changing, you'll need to rebuild the model and the SMC algorithm and recompile whenever you get a new data point.

In current nimble, you can't save compiled objects and close and restart R, so that would limit your flexibility here, regardless of the changing dimensionality.

-chris

